            <title>2.42.1</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 01:34:56 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>132</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.42.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Clicking a file link in a mirror pane opened the file on the host Mac instead of yours. 2.42.0 redirected an agent's `open`, but a click in a mirror pane is forwarded to the host as an `open_file` request and took a different path; it now goes through the same redirect, so the file is copied into `~/Downloads/from-<host>/` and opened here.
]]></description>
