        <item>
            <title>2.42.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 01:10:05 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>131</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.42.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Files and URLs an agent opens in a remote session now open on the Mac you are actually sitting at. This covers both SSH remote sessions and sessions mirrored from another Mac: a file is copied into `~/Downloads/from-<host>/` and opened there, a URL opens in your browser. With nobody watching from elsewhere, `open` behaves exactly as before. Requires ssh from the host back to your Mac; if that hop fails, the file opens on the host as it used to.

### Bug Fixes
- A MacroPad key press could fail to bring Canopy forward while certain apps (e.g. Arc) were frontmost — the activation request was carrying a stale hot-key timestamp and the system rejected it as expired.
]]></description>
