        <item>
            <title>2.41.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 19 Sep 2026 22:11:58 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>130</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.41.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- A session whose recent turns were very large (over 16 MB of transcript in the last 10 typed turns) could not be opened from the phone: the replay exceeded the line limit the phone accepts, and the connection was cut on every reconnect. The replay a phone receives is now fitted under the same 12 MB budget a Mac client's already was, measured after its images are deferred, so such a session opens with fewer turns instead of not at all.
]]></description>
